# Doppler local secret caches.
#
# `doppler.env` is a PBKDF2-encrypted fallback cache and `doppler.json` its
# config; both were tracked, and none of the patterns above match their
# filenames. Secrets for this project live in the logicsrc team vault
# (`coinpayportal--prod`), so these are obsolete as well as sensitive — but they
# remain in git history, which no .gitignore can undo.
doppler.env
doppler.json

